<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>WIPED OUT! — <%= node['hostname'] rescue 'Debian' %> // Chef Infra Telemetry</title>
  <style>
    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       TIPOGRAFÍA LOCAL: RANADE (Font Family)
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Ranade';
      src: url('./Fonts/Ranade-Light.woff2') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 300;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Ranade';
      src: url('./Fonts/Ranade-LightItalic.woff2') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 300;
      font-style: italic;
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Ranade';
      src: url('./Fonts/Ranade-Regular.woff2') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Ranade';
      src: url('./Fonts/Ranade-Medium.woff2') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 500;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Ranade';
      src: url('./Fonts/Ranade-MediumItalic.woff2') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 500;
      font-style: italic;
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Ranade';
      src: url('./Fonts/Ranade-Bold.woff2') format('woff2');
      font-weight: 700;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       SISTEMA DE DISEÑO NOIR: 'WIPED OUT!' MONOCHROME
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    :root {
      --bg-void: #050505;
      --bg-surface: #0a0a0a;
      --bg-card: #0f0f0f;
      --bg-card-hover: #141414;
      --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      --border-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
      --border-ghost: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      --text-pure: #ffffff;
      --text-muted: #a3a3a3;
      --text-dim: #666666;
      --text-faint: #444444;
      --accent-glow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      --font-stack: 'Ranade', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      --font-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    ::selection {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #050505;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-void);
      color: var(--text-pure);
      font-family: var(--font-stack);
      font-weight: 300;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    /* Ambient noise & grid lines */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: 
        linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 64px 64px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1080px;
      width: 100%;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       TOP BAR METADATA / RUNNER
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    .top-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-bottom: 0.85rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .meta-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .live-indicator {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--text-pure);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .pulse-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      animation: pulse 2.2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.9); }
      50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.25); box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); }
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       HERO: ALBUM ART & EDITORIAL HEADER
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    .hero-panel {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      padding: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Registration Crosshairs */
    .crosshair {
      position: absolute;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      line-height: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .crosshair-tl { top: 8px; left: 8px; }
    .crosshair-tr { top: 8px; right: 8px; }
    .crosshair-bl { bottom: 8px; left: 8px; }
    .crosshair-br { bottom: 8px; right: 8px; }

    .hero-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .artwork-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      background: #000000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    }

    .album-cover {
      max-width: 620px;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(110%);
      transition: filter 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .hero-header {
      padding: 2.25rem 2.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.95) 0%, rgba(10, 10, 10, 1) 100%);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .editorial-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.35em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }

    .album-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-pure);
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .album-subtitle {
      font-family: var(--font-stack);
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2vw, 1.15rem);
      font-weight: 300;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-stats-strip {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-ghost);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .hero-stats-strip span strong {
      color: var(--text-pure);
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       IDEMPOTENCY CERTIFICATE / MONOCHROME CALLOUT
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    .idempotency-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: var(--bg-card);
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      position: relative;
      transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .idempotency-box:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-strong);
    }

    .idempotency-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .idempotency-cert {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-pure);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .idempotency-cert::before {
      content: "";
      display: inline-block;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    }

    .idempotency-hash {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .idempotency-desc {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       SECTION TITLE / EDITORIAL RULE
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    .section-title-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .section-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-pure);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .section-rule {
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border-subtle);
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       BENTO GRID: TELEMETRY
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    .bento-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }

    .bento-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding: 1.65rem 1.75rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    .bento-card:hover {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      border-color: var(--border-strong);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Bento spans */
    .span-4 { grid-column: span 4; }
    .span-6 { grid-column: span 6; }
    .span-8 { grid-column: span 8; }
    .span-12 { grid-column: span 12; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .span-4, .span-6, .span-8 {
        grid-column: span 12;
      }
    }

    .card-kicker {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .card-kicker-tag {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-ghost);
      padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
    }

    .card-main-val {
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 1.95rem);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--text-pure);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .card-sub-val {
      font-family: var(--font-stack);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .card-footer-meta {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding-top: 0.85rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-ghost);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       PIPELINE WORKFLOW BAR
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    .pipeline-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .pipeline-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .pipeline-step {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-ghost);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      padding: 1.15rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .pipeline-step-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .pipeline-step-title {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--text-pure);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .pipeline-step-desc {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       TRACKLIST DE ENDPOINTS (VINYL AESTHETIC)
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    .tracklist-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .tracklist-header {
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .tracklist-header-title {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-pure);
    }

    .tracklist-header-meta {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .track-rows {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .track-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr auto auto;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1.35rem 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-ghost);
      gap: 1.5rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    .track-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .track-row:hover {
      background-color: var(--bg-card-hover);
    }

    .track-index {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .track-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .track-name {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--text-pure);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .track-caption {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    .track-runtime {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .track-status-pill {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      white-space: nowrap;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .track-status-active {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    }

    .track-status-active::before {
      content: "";
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    }

    .track-status-locked {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      border-color: var(--border-subtle);
      border-style: dashed;
    }

    .lock-glyph {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      opacity: 0.75;
    }

    .locked-callout {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--border-subtle);
      margin-top: -0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .track-row {
        grid-template-columns: 50px 1fr;
        gap: 0.75rem;
      }
      .track-runtime {
        display: none;
      }
      .track-status-pill {
        grid-column: 2;
        justify-self: start;
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
      }
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       FOOTER: EDITORIAL COLOFON
       -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-stack);
    }

    .footer-colofon {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      max-width: 800px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer-colofon strong {
      color: var(--text-pure);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .footer-meta {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .footer-watermark {
      opacity: 0.25;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Top Telemetry Ribbon -->
    <header class="top-meta">
      <div class="meta-group">
        <span class="live-indicator">
          <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
          SYS.CATALOG // ONLINE
        </span>
        <span>CHEF ZERO • LOCAL MODE</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-group">
        <span>SIDE A / 33⅓ RPM</span>
        <span>NOIR // SPEC. 2026</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Album Artwork Section: Wiped Out! -->
    <section class="hero-panel">
      <div class="crosshair crosshair-tl">+</div>
      <div class="crosshair crosshair-tr">+</div>
      <div class="crosshair crosshair-bl">+</div>
      <div class="crosshair crosshair-br">+</div>

      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="artwork-wrapper">
          <img 
            src="the-neighbourhood.jpg" 
            alt="The Neighbourhood — Wiped Out! Album Art" 
            class="album-cover"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="hero-header">
          <div class="editorial-badge">CAT NO. THE-NBHD-002 // CINC CLIENT AUTOMATION</div>
          <h1 class="album-title"><%= node['web_server']['site_title'] rescue 'WIPED OUT!' %></h1>
          <p class="album-subtitle"><%= node['web_server']['message'] rescue 'Lost and found in California // Autonomous Configuration Engine' %></p>
          
          <div class="hero-stats-strip">
            <span>PLATFORM: <strong><%= node['platform'].capitalize rescue 'Debian' %> <%= node['platform_version'] rescue '12' %></strong></span>
            <span>NODE: <strong><%= node['hostname'] rescue 'debian' %></strong></span>
            <span>PORT: <strong><%= node['web_server']['port'] rescue 80 %></strong></span>
            <span>ENVIRONMENT: <strong><%= node['web_server']['environment'] rescue 'Production' %></strong></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Certificate of Idempotence (Monochrome Callout) -->
    <section class="idempotency-box">
      <div class="idempotency-header">
        <div class="idempotency-cert">
          [ STATUS: CONVERGED // ZERO CONFIGURATION DRIFT ]
        </div>
        <div class="idempotency-hash">
          HASH: <%= Time.now.strftime("%Y%m%d") %>-CHEF-<%= (node['hostname'] rescue 'node').upcase %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="idempotency-desc">
        Este servidor ha alcanzado su estado deseado mediante convergencia idempotente de Chef Infra. Las ejecuciones subsecuentes verifican el catálogo en 0.00 segundos sin alterar ningún paquete ni servicio en ejecución.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section Divider: Telemetry -->
    <div class="section-title-wrap">
      <span class="section-num">01</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Ohai Hardware & System Telemetry</h2>
      <div class="section-rule"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid Telemetry -->
    <div class="bento-grid">
      <!-- Bento 1: Hostname / Node -->
      <div class="bento-card span-4">
        <div class="card-kicker">
          <span>01 // HOST IDENTIFIER</span>
          <span class="card-kicker-tag">NODE</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="card-main-val"><%= node['hostname'] rescue 'debian' %></div>
          <div class="card-sub-val">Identificador canónico del nodo gestionado en el catálogo Chef.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span>FQDN</span>
          <span><%= node['fqdn'] rescue "#{node['hostname']}.local" rescue 'debian.local' %></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento 2: Operating System -->
      <div class="bento-card span-4">
        <div class="card-kicker">
          <span>02 // OPERATING SYSTEM</span>
          <span class="card-kicker-tag">OHAI</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="card-main-val"><%= node['platform'].capitalize rescue 'Debian' %> <%= node['platform_version'] rescue '12' %></div>
          <div class="card-sub-val">Kernel: <%= node['os_version'] rescue 'Linux x86_64' %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span>FAMILY</span>
          <span><%= node['platform_family'].capitalize rescue 'Debian' %></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento 3: IP Address & Networking -->
      <div class="bento-card span-4">
        <div class="card-kicker">
          <span>03 // NETWORK INTERFACE</span>
          <span class="card-kicker-tag">ETH0</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="card-main-val"><%= node['ipaddress'] rescue '127.0.0.1' %></div>
          <div class="card-sub-val">Tráfico HTTP enrutado a través de Nginx en puerto <%= node['web_server']['port'] rescue 80 %>.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span>SOCKET</span>
          <span><%= node['ipaddress'] rescue '127.0.0.1' %>:<%= node['web_server']['port'] rescue 80 %></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento 4: Total Memory -->
      <div class="bento-card span-6">
        <div class="card-kicker">
          <span>04 // VOLATILE MEMORY</span>
          <span class="card-kicker-tag">RAM</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="card-main-val"><%= (node['memory']['total'].to_i / 1024 rescue '1024') %> MB</div>
          <div class="card-sub-val">Asignación de memoria física inspeccionada dinámicamente en tiempo de convergencia.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span>PROCESSOR</span>
          <span><%= node['cpu']['total'] rescue '1' %> CORE(S) ALLOCATED</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento 5: Convergence Timestamp -->
      <div class="bento-card span-6">
        <div class="card-kicker">
          <span>05 // LAST SYNCHRONIZATION</span>
          <span class="card-kicker-tag">TIMESTAMP</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="card-main-val" style="font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem);">
            <%= Time.now.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S") %>
          </div>
          <div class="card-sub-val">Timestamp exacto de la última compilación del recurso de plantilla.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span>CLIENT</span>
          <span>CHEF-ZERO / CINC ENGINE</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento 6: Execution Pipeline (Span 12) -->
      <div class="bento-card span-12">
        <div class="card-kicker">
          <span>06 // IDEMPOTENCY EXECUTION LIFECYCLE</span>
          <span class="card-kicker-tag">PHASES</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipeline-grid">
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <div class="pipeline-step-num">STAGE 01</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-title">Ohai Discovery</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-desc">Recolecta el inventario de hardware, kernel, red y jerarquía de sistema.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <div class="pipeline-step-num">STAGE 02</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-title">Compile Phase</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-desc">Evalúa recipes/default.rb y construye el Resource Collection en memoria.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <div class="pipeline-step-num">STAGE 03</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-title">Convergence</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-desc">Aplica mutaciones solo si el estado actual difiere del estado deseado.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <div class="pipeline-step-num">STAGE 04</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-title">Compliance</div>
            <div class="pipeline-step-desc">Auditoría en tiempo real. 0 fallas, 0 drift, servicio Nginx verificado.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section Divider: Tracklist -->
    <div class="section-title-wrap">
      <span class="section-num">02</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Tracklist de Endpoints // Classified Sectors</h2>
      <div class="section-rule"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tracklist de Endpoints (Teaser misterioso del Reto) -->
    <div class="tracklist-card">
      <div class="tracklist-header">
        <div class="tracklist-header-title">THE NEIGHBOURHOOD — TRACKLIST DIRECTORY</div>
        <div class="tracklist-header-meta">FORMAT: ERB / NGINX REVERSE-PROXY // 200 OK & LOCKED SECTORS</div>
      </div>

      <div class="track-rows">
        <!-- Track 01: /index.html -->
        <a href="/index.html" class="track-row">
          <div class="track-index">01.</div>
          <div class="track-info">
            <div class="track-name">
              /index.html
            </div>
            <div class="track-caption">Wiped Out! Main Editorial & Telemetry Hub</div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-runtime">03:15</div>
          <div>
            <span class="track-status-pill track-status-active">ACTIVE [200 OK]</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Track 02: /easter_egg.html (LOCKED SECTOR) -->
        <div class="track-row" style="cursor: not-allowed; opacity: 0.85;">
          <div class="track-index">02.</div>
          <div class="track-info">
            <div class="track-name">
              <span class="lock-glyph">&#128274;</span> /easter_egg.html
            </div>
            <div class="track-caption">El Monumento Oculto • Augustus Caesar Archive</div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-runtime">--:--</div>
          <div>
            <span class="track-status-pill track-status-locked">
              <span class="lock-glyph">&#128274;</span> LOCKED SECTOR [404 NOT FOUND]
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Locked Sector Hint Callout -->
        <div class="locked-callout">
          &gt;&gt; REQUERIMIENTO DE CONVERGENCIA: Para desbloquear el Sector 02 (/easter_egg.html), agrega el recurso template 'easter_egg.html.erb' en 'cookbooks/web_server/recipes/default.rb' y ejecuta 'vagrant provision'.
        </div>

        <!-- Track 03: Thematic Vinyl Track -->
        <div class="track-row" style="opacity: 0.45; cursor: default;">
          <div class="track-index">03.</div>
          <div class="track-info">
            <div class="track-name">/rip_2_my_youth.flac</div>
            <div class="track-caption">The Neighbourhood — Track 11 // Master Reference Archive</div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-runtime">03:26</div>
          <div>
            <span class="track-status-pill track-status-locked">ARCHIVED [STANDBY]</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Colofón y Footer -->
    <footer>
      <div class="footer-colofon">
        Desarrollado para la materia de <strong>Despliegue de Software</strong> • 7° Semestre • Universidad Veracruzana
        <br>
        Infraestructura como Código (IaC) orquestada por <strong>Chef Infra (Cinc Client)</strong> &amp; <strong>Vagrant</strong>
        <br>
        Presentado por: <strong><%= node['web_server']['author'] rescue 'Equipo UV - Despliegue de Software' %></strong>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-meta">
        NODE: <%= node['hostname'] rescue 'debian' %> // OS: <%= node['platform'].capitalize rescue 'Debian' %> // RUNLIST: recipe[web_server::default]
      </div>
      <div class="footer-watermark">
        THE NEIGHBOURHOOD — WIPED OUT! // NOIR EDITION © 2026
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
